     hhttttppss::////wwwwww..uussbb..oorrgg//hhiidd

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The uuppdd driver first appeared in OpenBSD 5.6.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The uuppdd driver was written by Andre de Oliveira.

BBUUGGSS
     The uuppdd driver does not indicate device health via aggregate or individ‐
     ual sensor status.  Users who wish to monitor uuppdd status using
     sensorsd(8) must manually establish “high” and “low” limits for sensor
     values of interest via sensorsd.conf(5).

